<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Mysql - 标签 - 大卓个人技术博客</title><link>https://nuoyang.tech/tags/mysql/</link><description>大卓个人技术博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.155.3 &amp; FixIt v0.3.21-89f9373b</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>lvatticus@gmail.com (大卓)</managingEditor><webMaster>lvatticus@gmail.com (大卓)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Thu, 16 Mar 2023 15:28:48 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://nuoyang.tech/tags/mysql/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>mysql修改root密码，修复caching_sha2_password无法连接问题</title><link>https://nuoyang.tech/tech/other/mysql_caching_sha2_password/</link><pubDate>Sat, 17 Jul 2021 20:11:06 +0000</pubDate><author>lvatticus@gmail.com (大卓)</author><guid>https://nuoyang.tech/tech/other/mysql_caching_sha2_password/</guid><category domain="https://nuoyang.tech/categories/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/">技术</category><category domain="https://nuoyang.tech/categories/database/">Database</category><description>&lt;p&gt;通过Sequel连接mysql时发现无法连接，报错为：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-gdscript3" data-lang="gdscript3"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;MySQL&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;said&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Authentication&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;plugin&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;caching_sha2_password&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;cannot&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;be&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;loaded&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;dlopen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;usr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;local&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;lib&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;pl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.....&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;原因是mysql8默认为&lt;strong&gt;caching_sha2_password&lt;/strong&gt;加密方式，而sequel只支持&lt;strong&gt;mysql_native_password&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>